
# Apache Website Deployment Files

This folder contains the files I used to deploy a static website using Ansible Playbooks.

## Files

- `first-playbook.yaml` – Installs Apache, copies the HTML file and starts the Apache service.
- `index.html` – Contains the static website deployed on both managed nodes.

## Execution

Check playbook syntax:

```bash
ansible-playbook -i inventory.ini first-playbook.yaml --syntax-check
```

Execute the playbook:

```bash
ansible-playbook -i inventory.ini first-playbook.yaml
```

## Result

Successfully installed Apache and deployed my HTML website on two AWS EC2 managed nodes.
